      "strings": {
        "spell_locker_tooltip": "Locke throws a binding artifact to a location, dealing <magicDamage>@Damage@ magic damage</magicDamage> and <status>Slowing</status> enemies in the area by @SlowAmount*100@%, decaying over @SlowDuration@ seconds. The artifact marks enemies hit for @Duration@ seconds, sealing away marked enemy champions brought below <spellName>@ExecuteTooltipCalc@</spellName>, and resetting the duration of the mark on other affected champions.<br><br>After the duration ends, if at least one champion was sealed, the artifact lands on the ground. Locke can pick up the artifact to permanently increase its execution threshold by @ExecuteThresholdPerStack*100@%, and refund @CooldownReduction@% of his total Cooldown, for each champion sealed.<br>"
      }
